<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-TC-004

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-TC-005
TITLE: Expected Output Configuration
STATEMENT: >>>
The software shall support configurable expected output with match type (exact, regex,
schema), comparison values, and optional flags.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-TC-005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-TC-006
TITLE: Prerequisite Management
STATEMENT: >>>
The software shall manage test prerequisites with type (manual/automatic), description,
verification commands, and completion status.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-TC-006

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-TC-007
TITLE: Environment Variable Management
STATEMENT: >>>
The software shall manage required and optional environment variables with defaults,
validation, and substitution into test commands.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-TC-007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-TC-008
TITLE: Hook Point Configuration
STATEMENT: >>>
The software shall support configurable lifecycle hooks at eight execution points with
command specifications and error handling behavior.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-TC-008

